WEBVTT

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:07.470
Come on, everyone, take a look!

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:13.180
I've got the perfect 
invention just for you!

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:14.700
First up...

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.460
We've got these false teeth!

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.370
The High-Speed Automatic Biting 
and Crushing Dentures!

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.040
They're very easy to use!

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.020
You just put them in your mouth

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:30.100
and they'll bite whatever 
you want into little pieces.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:39.490
Ow!

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.480
Ow...

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:51.650
But wait, there's more!

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:54.980
We've also got this alarm clock!

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.530
But it's no ordinary alarm clock!

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:00.000
This alarm clock is like no other...

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:09.150
I'm just fine...

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:13.130
And now the main event!

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.890
When I press the switch 
on this controller...

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:29.310
It turns into a portable fishing rod, which

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:33.940
lets you cast a line wherever you want!

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:42.860
W-Wait!

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:44.270
I'm not done yet!

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:47.670
Huh?

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:53.890
I didn't sell a thing today...

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:00.720
How nice!

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:04.470
Just looking at them 
makes me feel better.

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:10.980
Okay, I'll try my best again tomorrow!

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:50.180
Like this?

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:52.210
No, that's not right.

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:56.560
Oh, I see. It goes like this!

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.560
Intruder approaching!

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:04.020
Protect the brilliant inventions!

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:05.220
You here, Gennai?

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:09.180
Gennai?

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.840
Oh, you're here, assistant.

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:12.390
I'm not your assistant.

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:15.360
Look at all that mud!

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:17.000
Wipe your shoes.

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:26.420
You were playing with balls again?

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:28.780
It's not "playing with balls,"
 it's "soccer."

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:32.400
You just kick it around.
So, you're playing with it.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:34.700
I've got practice every day.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.200
There's a game coming up.

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:40.920
But didn't you say you don't get
 play time because you suck?

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.890
If I practice a lot and try really hard,

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:46.770
they'll let me in someday.

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:47.510
Probably.

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:50.260
So that's how it works, huh?

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.680
Sheesh, and I was being
 nice by bringing you this.

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:04.820
Great!

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.910
Your manners are terrible.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.940
I'm just fine.

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:10.150
It's from my grandma,

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:12.070
so you don't get heatstroke.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:16.000
This world's so great,

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.260
you get eel whenever you want it.

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:20.630
You think so?

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.660
I don't really like eel.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:24.170
What a waste!

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:28.930
Without those delicious nutrients, 
you couldn't have geniuses like me!

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:34.160
This world's got "eel day" 
every Saturday, right?

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.180
I wonder whose idea it was

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:38.900
to devote one day a week to eating eel.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.940
I'm sure they must've been 
a genius who loved eel!

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:45.040
Hey, this time machine...

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.310
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:48.480
It's not a time machine.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.410
It's the Wandering Mountain Woman.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:52.950
Wandering Mountain Woman.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:56.020
But that's hard to remember.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:01.280
So, when it's done, 
are you going back to the past?

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:05.710
The world I lived in and this 
one are in different timelines.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:09.720
So she can't take me home.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:10.720
I see.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:14.500
And she's a future-only 
time travel device.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:20.690
What I'm after is a future 
with flying cars and aliens!

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:23.040
I can't wait to see it!

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:26.950
All the inventions we can't even 
imagine with our science...

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:29.560
I'm sure it'll be wonderful!

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:31.740
Hey, can I get in?

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.370
Sure thing.

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:42.250
All right, if we can just 
get enough energy now,

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:45.530
it's a straight trip through the time spiral!

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:47.240
Hey, keep pedaling.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.010
Oh, right.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:56.060
Hey.

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:59.350
In the future, am I a soccer player?

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:01.740
Beats me.

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:03.360
Man, my butt hurts.

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:07.360
Well, if you don't give 
up and keep at it,

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.110
you'll probably get somewhere someday.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:13.110
It wasn't that long ago 
you were giving up.

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:15.070
"I can't go on!" Thud.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.060
That was...

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.060
Results are all that matter.

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:23.250
If you get results, 
then everything's fine.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.380
After that, I tried really 
hard, so I'm good.

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:27.110
I see.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:30.270
Then I'll try really hard, too!

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:32.180
That way I can play in a game.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.550
I don't get what's so fun...

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.410
about playing with that ball.

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:48.900
It's all blackened.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.480
I'm gonna have to fix some things.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:53.530
I want to make the seats comfy,

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:56.040
and perhaps add a cup holder.

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:58.680
Or maybe a mini-fridge.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:03.440
I should write this down...

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:05.670
Any paper around here?

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:08.870
Hey!

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:10.670
This'll do just fine.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:12.960
Let's see...

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:14.970
Stop it, Gennai!

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.860
Stop struggling, assistant.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:18.930
Don't scribble on me!

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.940
<b>Kagaya Hot Springs</b>

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:37.140
I had a lot of failures again today.

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:50.260
Okay, I'll do my best tomorrow, too!

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.910
I wonder what baths in 
the future are like.

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:06.520
Maybe they've got a super bubble bath
that eliminates shoulder pain instantly.

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:11.050
Or maybe they're so advanced, 
they don't take baths.

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:13.520
I wonder what it's like...

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:16.580
When I first came here...

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:33.050
I'll never forget how I felt at that moment.

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.740
If I can go further into the future,

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:38.360
I should be able to see even more things!

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.050
Yeah!

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:01.830
That hurt...

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:06.160
I guess I fell asleep.

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:11.920
I'm hungry...

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:30.650
I know!

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:36.650
Looking good!

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:40.710
Intruder approaching!

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:44.160
Protect the brilliant inventions!

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:44.160
Gennai!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.160
What's with all this smoke?

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:49.090
What's burning?

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:50.760
Kabayaki.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:52.170
That's eel, isn't it?

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:54.690
I'm making it with fish cakes!

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:56.670
Fish cakes?

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:59.220
With creativity and the 
spirit of inquiry,

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:01.390
fish cakes can surpass even eel!

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.560
Real eel's expensive, isn't it?

00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:07.520
Anyway, Gennai.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:08.960
What is it, assistant?

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:11.670
They're putting me on 
the bench next game!

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:13.110
Just as a substitute, though.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:14.550
I see.

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:16.390
Be happy for me!

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:18.690
Fine, fine. Great job.

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:22.820
If I'm on the bench, it 
means I might get to play!

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.950
You'll come to see the game, right?

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.350
Aww, nah.

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:30.150
It's boring.

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:31.610
Don't be like that.

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:33.440
Come see me.

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:36.420
It might be my first appearance!

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:45.280
My kabayaki!

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:07.010
Intruder approaching!

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:10.160
Protect the brilliant inventions!

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.250
There we go.

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:23.590
That's most of what I need.

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:26.140
Just a little more and I'm done.

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:36.400
And that's it.

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.270
I did it!

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:43.650
Now to fiddle with the 
aesthetics a little.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.510
It's finally done!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:05.050
Comfy seats and a cup holder!

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:08.290
Now my journey to the 
future will be luxurious!

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:12.010
I couldn't fit the mini-fridge 
into the budget,

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:15.770
but it's such a stylish 
and beautiful hull!

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:19.200
It reflects my futuristic style!

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:23.070
I can't wait to show my assistant!

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:26.570
I hope he gets here soon.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:31.120
Will he be happy when I tell him 
I'll take him to the future?

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:36.830
He's late.

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:39.400
He's late! Late! Late!

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:41.480
He'd normally be here by now!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:47.970
Fine, I'll go get him from school.

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:05.820
Huh?

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:08.150
He's not here.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:12.900
Hey, kiddos.

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:14.330
Got a sec?

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:17.160
An accident?

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.740
Yeah. The teacher just told us.

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:22.440
It happened in the shopping district.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:23.940
Near the eel shop.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.060
Yeah.

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:27.950
He tried to save a cat that was 
about to get hit by a car...

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:29.180
And he got run over?

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:33.180
No, it just smacked him 
and fractured his leg.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.460
I see.

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:37.560
Still, I feel bad for him.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.810
Yeah. He was working 
so hard to have a shot

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.440
at being in the game tomorrow.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.500
Assistant.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.370
Gennai.

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:02.660
You came to see me.

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:06.640
The Wandering Mountain Woman is done,

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:08.330
so I thought I'd give you a ride in it.

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:10.750
I went to your school and then...

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:13.810
I see.

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:15.460
They're making a really 
big deal out of this.

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:16.950
It's just a fracture.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:19.350
They said since I'm growing, 
I need to keep it stable.

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:24.920
But I might not be able to pedal 
the time machine for a while.

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.810
And the game tomorrow...

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:30.110
If you keep at it and don't give up, 
you'll get another chance.

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:33.340
It's all right.

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:35.610
Even if I didn't get hurt,

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:38.120
I don't think I would've played tomorrow.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:40.380
That's not true.

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:43.380
They chose you because 
you practiced every day.

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:44.540
It's all right.

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:47.350
You're gonna practice every day 
once you get better, right?

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:48.970
So you can be in a game?

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:50.630
I said it's fine!

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:55.200
I don't care anymore.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.930
That does it!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:43.940
Theoretically, this should let me 
go back in time to yesterday.

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:50.280
Now all I have to see is if 
I can go to the right time.

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:53.640
I made it for traveling into the
future, so I don't know

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:56.110
what'll happen if I try 
to go into the past!

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:03.710
But... I can't be worrying 
about that now!

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:52.700
Ow...

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:58.110
Wandering...

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:01.000
Where am I?

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:03.280
Outside the lab?

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:05.140
I guess my landing point was off.

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:10.650
Did I really go back into the past?

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:15.440
Intruder approaching!

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:18.660
Protect the brilliant inventions!

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:24.480
That's definitely me!

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:26.470
I made it back to the past!

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:28.540
I really am a genius!

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:32.390
It's later than I planned!

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:33.810
I have to hurry!

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:37.920
Gotta hurry...

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.140
There he is.

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:45.140
That's him.

00:18:53.740 --> 00:18:55.820
Gotcha.

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:57.450
There we go.

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:06.410
Jeez, that was close.

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:08.160
I did it!

00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:59.970
You said you were busy,

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:02.090
but you still came to see me, Gennai.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:03.920
I guess so.

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:05.850
I'm glad you got to play.

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.250
We lost, though.

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:10.290
And I didn't get to do much.

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:12.230
Don't worry about it.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:15.810
If you got to play in a game, that 
brings you one step closer.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:17.020
Yeah.

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.000
I need to work hard, too.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.740
It's a hard path, 
traveling to the future.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:26.360
You're going sightseeing when 
you get to the future, right?

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:27.380
That's right.

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:30.120
I'll see every last 
thing there is to see.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:33.270
And then I'll use their 
latest technology to make

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:35.950
something even better 
than what they've got!

00:20:36.490 --> 00:20:40.290
But it might be nice not
 jumping hundreds of years ahead,

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:42.630
and instead seeing the process of evolution.

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.800
Like jumping every ten years.

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:47.950
Then will you see me in the future?

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:49.390
Sure will!

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.830
Will I be a soccer player?

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.400
I dunno about that.

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:58.320
You said if I didn't give 
up and kept working,

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.900
it'd work out, right?

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:02.220
I did.

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:04.410
Then it'll probably work out, right?

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:05.670
Yeah!

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:08.780
Well, let's head home.

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:10.030
Okay.

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:17.880
What happened?!

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:20.240
Um...

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:23.280
It broke during an experiment.

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:24.380
I see.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:26.080
Can you fix it?

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:28.890
Nope.

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:31.200
The Erekiteru's busted,
 and it's a critical part.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:32.640
I can't repair it.

00:21:33.070 --> 00:21:35.890
Dunno what to do.

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:37.010
Gennai.

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:40.200
Cheer up, Gennai.

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:42.280
I got to play in a game,

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:44.740
so if you try hard, you should be able to

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.790
finish the Wandering 
Mountain Woman someday.

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:48.410
It's okay.

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:51.920
I'm done with this research project.

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:54.870
You're giving up on going to the future?

00:21:57.090 --> 00:21:58.840
It's not that.

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:01.700
I like the future,

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:05.880
but I think I want to bring 
happiness to the people here, too.

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:08.180
I see.

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:48.100
I peaked into the future,

00:23:48.100 --> 00:23:50.850
and next time it's the 
famous poet, Matsuo Basho!

00:23:50.850 --> 00:23:54.030
Next time on Sengoku 
Collection: "Divine Bard."

00:23:54.030 --> 00:23:56.460
My next invention is a device 
that goes back in time

00:23:56.460 --> 00:23:59.040
and records anime you missed!
